            "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/a2f72af14212c9ee2bcd258bf5cf4cf0.avif?t=1794208524\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras_big/a2f72af14212c9ee2bcd258bf5cf4cf0.avif?t=1794208524 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of one of the Chickenfolk, trapped beneath the Humanfolk’s endless tyranny. Break free from the chains of fate and rise as their leader - the Chicken King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first half of the story focuses on combat, exploration, and player growth. In the second half, you’ll lead your people as the Chicken King: reclaim your homeland, build up your village, and hold the line against wave after wave of Humanfolk assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat takes center stage, paired with exploration. Along the way, you’ll experience wilderness survival, hire mercenaries, put Chickenfolk to work, and defend your village. As a free-form, genre-bending ARPG, <strong>Last Chickenburg</strong> features a wide array of unique interactive mechanics waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/d268249215e710cad55ce5a74caf85b8.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=223 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is stripped down to its purest form. Every weapon has just one move, so victory hinges on reading enemy tells and timing your strikes. You and your enemies play by the same rules - they may hunt for healing items and scoop up any equipment lying around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two battles never play out the same. A single move can play out completely differently depending on the terrain and how many fighters are in the fray. Master the rules, and you’ll uncover new ways to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/4fdd570386cf6935ef7f8f507cfd5ba7.poster.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/4fdd570386cf6935ef7f8f507cfd5ba7.webm?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/4fdd570386cf6935ef7f8f507cfd5ba7.mp4?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/2531059fb96a30cef332597fd6bfc3a1.poster.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/2531059fb96a30cef332597fd6bfc3a1.webm?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/2531059fb96a30cef332597fd6bfc3a1.mp4?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/7b0ea0274438eae8b30233acf3aebe5a.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=223 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget what you know about traditional ARPGs. <strong>Last Chickenburg</strong> is full of clever interaction mechanics that deliver a fresh gameplay experience. One unified set of interaction rules applies to combat, exploration, and NPC encounters. Learn and master these systems, and you can bend the world to your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/0d052f8cd34e58ab869e333ee49c4c88.poster.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/0d052f8cd34e58ab869e333ee49c4c88.webm?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/0d052f8cd34e58ab869e333ee49c4c88.mp4?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/dc3022754daabfe46e09ceedd9db4079.poster.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/dc3022754daabfe46e09ceedd9db4079.webm?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/dc3022754daabfe46e09ceedd9db4079.mp4?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/00c739e755e8c07658747bb203d1c49a.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=223 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later in the story, recruit mercenaries to join your journey, carry supplies, and fight alongside you. Capture strongholds, use houses to raise new Chickenfolk, and put your growing community to work forging weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanfolk raiding parties will keep coming for your villages. Turn what you’ve produced into gear, arm your flock, and defend your home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/be01a839a257ef9a5604b7e42e83c210.poster.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/be01a839a257ef9a5604b7e42e83c210.webm?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/be01a839a257ef9a5604b7e42e83c210.mp4?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/a25e554d3d57c907e5523ae027a0c9e1.poster.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/a25e554d3d57c907e5523ae027a0c9e1.webm?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/a25e554d3d57c907e5523ae027a0c9e1.mp4?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of one of the Chickenfolk, trapped beneath the Humanfolk’s endless tyranny. Break free from the chains of fate and rise as their leader - the Chicken King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first half of the story focuses on combat, exploration, and player growth. In the second half, you’ll lead your people as the Chicken King: reclaim your homeland, build up your village, and hold the line against wave after wave of Humanfolk assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat takes center stage, paired with exploration. Along the way, you’ll experience wilderness survival, hire mercenaries, put Chickenfolk to work, and defend your village. As a free-form, genre-bending ARPG, <strong>Last Chickenburg</strong> features a wide array of unique interactive mechanics waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/d268249215e710cad55ce5a74caf85b8.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=223 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is stripped down to its purest form. Every weapon has just one move, so victory hinges on reading enemy tells and timing your strikes. You and your enemies play by the same rules - they may hunt for healing items and scoop up any equipment lying around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two battles never play out the same. A single move can play out completely differently depending on the terrain and how many fighters are in the fray. Master the rules, and you’ll uncover new ways to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/4fdd570386cf6935ef7f8f507cfd5ba7.poster.avif?t=1794208524\" wi