m/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/0d052f8cd34e58ab869e333ee49c4c88.webm?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/0d052f8cd34e58ab869e333ee49c4c88.mp4?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/dc3022754daabfe46e09ceedd9db4079.poster.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/dc3022754daabfe46e09ceedd9db4079.webm?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/dc3022754daabfe46e09ceedd9db4079.mp4?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/00c739e755e8c07658747bb203d1c49a.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=223 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later in the story, recruit mercenaries to join your journey, carry supplies, and fight alongside you. Capture strongholds, use houses to raise new Chickenfolk, and put your growing community to work forging weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanfolk raiding parties will keep coming for your villages. Turn what you’ve produced into gear, arm your flock, and defend your home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/be01a839a257ef9a5604b7e42e83c210.poster.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/be01a839a257ef9a5604b7e42e83c210.webm?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/be01a839a257ef9a5604b7e42e83c210.mp4?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/a25e554d3d57c907e5523ae027a0c9e1.poster.avif?t=1794208524\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/a25e554d3d57c907e5523ae027a0c9e1.webm?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/a25e554d3d57c907e5523ae027a0c9e1.mp4?t=1794208524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
